  @prompt
    create hte swction i need to add the embed code and add the heading and i need to change the width and height everthing manually and  font size for hedaing to \, i need to chang eht text color and paddign aand margin to  and i need  change the text and , remove the padding for the videoas onoy i  need the headibg what i need is in heading i need text alignment and text padding margin thos things i  video i need to give mebed code and manulalyt change the width adn height everthing
